    - rid: 1000
      type: {class: BtRoot, ns: CGD.BehaviorTrees, asm: CGD.Runtime}
      data:
        _guid: 6d49cff2022d46e0877fcdefb02ebd62
        _position: {x: 0, y: 0}
        _comment: 'A bombardier (mortar bot, spore lobber, hex-thrower — any faction): stays far back behind cover and lobs its kit grenade onto where its target was last seen — it doesn''t need to see it, its kin''s reports keep it informed — every 4 s; backs off from anything within 12 m. Needs EnemyData › Kit › Grenade (a long-range one).'
        _children:
        - eb7be8d21ffd47fd99201c837e089a38
